/**
 * PointCast front door — rebuilt 2026-09-01 to carry the whole town.
 *
 * Mike: "redo pointcast homepage, have it flourish with all that's been built …
 * its still super experimental, we have no visitors … lets keep going, playing
 * the long game."
 *
 * Order: play first (the Rosebud pads codex shipped on 08-31, full garden at
 * /rosebud) → start here → the town at a glance → the magazine rack → the drum
 * house → rooms & rituals → the constellation → the agent desk → the ship log →
 * the register → the wire → the back catalog → channels → machine surfaces.
 *
 * Every curated door lives in the arrays below so the ~44 tests that read this
 * file can grep hrefs. Every number is computed from repo data at build or
 * pinned once in PINNED with its source and date, and the live ones refresh
 * client-side with the build-time value as the fallback.
 */
